FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION OF [COMPANY NAME] ULC

RESOLVED, that the subscription by the incorporator for 1,000 common shares at a consideration of C$1.00 per share is accepted and the share register issued accordingly;

RESOLVED, that the Corporation's registered office is established at [Registered Office Address], Calgary, Alberta, with the minute book and corporate registers maintained there;

RESOLVED, that [Name] is appointed Chief Executive Officer, [Name] Chief Financial Officer, and [Name] Corporate Secretary, each authorized to open banking and documentary credit facilities and to execute customs, GST/HST and Safe Food for Canadians licence filings;

RESOLVED FURTHER, that the Corporation adopts a corporate seal and ratifies all formation expenses.
